<title>CANADA: Black Hawk Mining files for shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Black Hawk Mining files for shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Black Hawk Mining Inc said on Monday it has filed a notice of intention to buy back up to 4.1 million, or five percent, of its common shares.</p>
<p>Black Hawk said in a statement the Toronto Stock Exchange has accepted the notice for a normal course issuer bid.</p>
<p>Black Hawk has about 83 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
